CM_ BO_ 2163223550 "Crash Notification";
CM_ SG_ 2163223550 CrashChecksum "Crash Checksum: The Crash Checksum is used to verify the signal path from the airbag ECU to other devices in case of a crash.The 4 bit checksum is the sum of the high nibble and the low nibble of the sum of the identifier, the first 7 data bytes and ...";
CM_ SG_ 2163223550 CrashCounter "Crash Counter: The Crash Counter prevents other ECUs from reacting to a faulty transmission of the Crash Notification PG and serves as a safety mechanism. The Crash Counter becomes incremented by 1 for every sent message, and wraps around to 0 when t...";
CM_ SG_ 2163223550 CrashType "Crash Type: Type of crash event. 00000b = no crash00001b = frontal crash00010b = rear crash00100b = side crash (left)01000b = side crash (right)10000b = rolloverIt is possible to combine different Crash Types. (e.g. frontal and side crash (left) = 00...";
CM_ BO_ 2230333950 "Wand Sensor";
CM_ SG_ 2230333950 WandAngle "Wand Angle: A wand sensor measures the angle of deflection of a wand from its null position. This parameter reports the measured angle of a wand sensor.";
CM_ SG_ 2230333950 WandSensorFigureOfMerit "Wand Sensor Figure of Merit: Figure of Merit sensor status for a wand sensor.00b = Sensor fully functional01b = Sensor degraded10b = Sensor failed11b = Sensor not available";
CM_ BO_ 2230334206 "Linear Displacement Sensor";
CM_ SG_ 2230334206 MeasuredLinearDisplacement "Measured Linear Displacement: Distance to target as measured by the Linear Displacement Sensor.";
CM_ SG_ 2230334206 LnrDsplmntSnsrSnsrFgrOfMrt "Linear Displacement Sensor Sensor Figure of Merit: Figure of Merit sensor status of Linear Displacement Sensor.00b = Sensor fully functional01b = Sensor degraded10b = Sensor failed11b = Sensor not available";
CM_ BO_ 2297441534 "Magnet Status Information 2";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 DropRelayControl "Drop Relay Control: Command signal used to Engage and Disengage the Drop Relay controlling a Steady-State Magnet.00b = Off, Disable Drop Relay Request01b = On, Enable Drop Relay Request10b = Reserved11b = Take No Action";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 GnrtrCrrntBstAtvStts "Generator Current Boost Active Status: Status of generator current boost relay that can boost the generator output current for picking-up material operations. When this relay is on, the generator is generating the maximum current for the material han...";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 LiftRelayControl "Lift Relay Control: Command signal used to Engage and Disengage the Lift Relay controlling a Steady-State Magnet.00b = Off, Disable Lift Relay Request 01b = On, Enable Lift Relay Request10b = Reserved11b = Take No Action";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 MagnetForwardCurrent "Magnet Forward Current: The forward current being supplied by the generator to the electric magnet to create a magnet field to lift material.";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 MagnetGeneratorControl "Magnet Generator Control: Command signal used to Enable and Disable the Generator controlling a Magnet.00b = Off, Disable Generator01b = On, Enable Generator10b = Reserved11b = Take No Action";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 MagnetReverseCurrent "Magnet Reverse Current: A reverse current being supplied to the electric magnet to reduce the forward current generated magnet field as quick as possible so that the magnet can release material as fast as possible.";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 MaterialDropActiveStatus "Material Drop Active Status: The status of Material Drop Relay. When it is on, the generator generates reverse direction current so that the material handler machine can release material.00b = Off01b = On10b = Error11b = Not Available";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 MaterialDropSwitch "Material Drop Switch: This is a switch that can be used to enable the drop functionality of the Material Handler machine.00b = Don't Drop01b = Drop10b = Error11b = Not Available";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 MaterialLiftActiveStatus "Material Lift Active Status: The status of Material Lift Relay. When it is on, the generator generates forward direction current so that the material handler machine can pick up material.00b = Off01b = On10b = Error11b = Not Available";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 MaterialLiftSwitch "Material Lift Switch: This is a switch that can be used to enable the lift functionality of the Material Handler machine. When it is activated, the magnet is energized to pick up material.00b = Don't Lift01b = Lift10b = Error11b = Not Available...";
