CM_ BO_ 2362572542 "Air Suspension Control 6";
CM_ SG_ 2362572542 LevelPresetFrontAxleLeft "Level Preset Front Axle Left: Set value for nominal level 'preset level' at the left side of the front axle. This value is referred to 'Normal level 1'.  For explanations of normal level 1 see parameter SPN 1734 - Nominal Level Front Axle.";
