CM_ BO_ 2364553726 "Engine Air System Information";
CM_ SG_ 2364553726 EngineDesiredAirFuelRatio "Engine Desired Air Fuel Ratio: Reports the desired Air Fuel ratio for the engine.Air Fuel Ratio specifies the amount of air required to completely burn one unit of fuel in the engine to meet the required engine performance and emission standards.";
