CM_ SG_ 2364575998 HvessVoltageLevel "HVESS Voltage Level: The voltage level of the High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack). This parameter should be synchronized with SPN 5920 (HVESS Current) such that a realized power value can be calculated.  If th...";
