CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngineCoolantPumpControl "Engine Coolant Pump Control: Control setting for an electrically actuated engine coolant circulating pump. 00b = Off01b = On10b = Reserved11b = Don't care / take no action.";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngineDerateRequest "Engine Derate Request: This parameter is a derate request made from the engine control system to an external system, where the engine is requesting an external device to reduce the load being applied.  A zero value indicates that there is no derate b...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngineDesiredTorqueRequest "Engine Desired Torque Request: This is the torque that the ECM desires to provide. It is a request made from the ECM to an external system. A valid value within the operating range indicates the engine is requesting an external controller to change t...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngineFuelShutoff1Control "Engine Fuel Shutoff 1 Control: Control setting for fuel shutoff 1.  The second instance is SPN 2807.  For a single fuel shutoff system, this represents its commanded position.  For a dual fuel shutoff system, this SP is representative of the upstream...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngineFuelShutoff2Control "Engine Fuel Shutoff 2 Control: Control setting for fuel shutoff 2.  First instance is SPN 632.  For a dual fuel shutoff system, this SP is representative of the downstream fuel shutoff commanded position.  When fuel (gas) is desired at the engine, th...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngineFuelShutoffVentControl "Engine Fuel Shutoff Vent Control: Control setting for a fuel shutoff vent.  Typically, for a dual fuel shutoff system, the vent line is located between them and is plumbed to vent outside to atmosphere.  The vent control typically always actuates opp...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngineOilPreHeaterControl "Engine Oil Pre-heater Control: Control setting for an electrically actuated oil pre-heating device.00b = Off01b = On10b = Reserved11b = Don't care / take no actionIn addition to communicating desired action of the electrically actuated oil pre-heater...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngineOilPrimingPumpControl "Engine Oil Priming Pump Control: This control is used to activate a pump that lubricates the engine, particularly prior to initial engine startup.00b = Off01b = On10b = Reserved11b = unavailable";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngineOperatingState "Engine Operating State: This parameter is used to indicate the current state, or mode, of operation by the engine.  This is a status parameter.0000b = Engine Stopped0001b = Pre-Start0010b = Starting0011b = Warm-Up0100b = Running0101b = Cool-down0110b...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EnginePreHeaterControl "Engine Pre-Heater Control: Control setting for an electrically actuated engine block or coolant pre-heating device.00b = Off 01b = On10b = Reserved11b = Unavailable";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngineStarterMotorRelayControl "Engine Starter Motor Relay Control: Command signal used to energize or de-energize the engine starter motor relay.00b = Off01b = On10b = Reserved for SAE assignment11b = Don't care/take no action";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngnCldAmntElvtdIdlStts "Engine Cold Ambient Elevated Idle Status: Indicates that the engine is elevating the idle speed due to cold strategies.00b = No Idle Elevation Active - standard idle speed01b = Idle Elevation Active10b = Reserved for SAE assignment11b = Unavailable...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngnEltrlSstmPwrCnsrvtnCntrl "Engine Electrical System Power Conservation Control: Control setting for cutting power to various devices when the engine is not in use.  Useful if it is desired to keep the engine in standby, with main control ECU still powered on and communictaing ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngnEmrgnImmdtShtdwnIndtn "Engine Emergency (Immediate) Shutdown Indication: A signal issued by the engine control system to a user or external system indicating that it is immediately shutting the engine down.  This indication is made when engine protection diagnostics determ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 EngnFlShtffVlvLkTstCntrl "Engine Fuel Shutoff Valve Leak Test Control: Control setting for fuel shutoff valve proving system test.  Typically, this type of system can only be used with a dual fuel shutoff system.  The test consists of a small pump to pressurize the chamber be...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 FuelPumpPrimerControl "Fuel Pump Primer Control: Parameter used to activate or deactivate a priming system on the fuel transfer system. The fuel priming system is a system that purges air in the fuel lines and may assist fuel delivery to a second pump at lower speeds.00b =...";
CM_ SG_ 2365428478 TmRmnngInEngnOprtngStt "Time Remaining in Engine Operating State: This parameter is used to indicate the time remaining in the current engine operating state, based on the state defined in the SP Engine Operating State (SPN 3543). For the states in which time remaining is n...";
