CM_ BO_ 2633764094 "Evaporative Systems";
CM_ SG_ 2633764094 CanisterPurgeValveCommand "Canister Purge Valve Command: The commanded positon of the canister purge valve used to allow fuel vapors from the charcoal canister into the intake manifold.A value of 0 % indicates fully closed, a value of 100 % indicates fully open.";
CM_ SG_ 2633764094 CanisterVentValve "Canister Vent Valve: The state of the canister vent value used to allow fresh air into the charcoal vapor canister.00b = Vent Valve is Closed01b = Vent Valve is Open10b = Error11b = Not Available";
CM_ SG_ 2633764094 GasolineFuelTankPressure "Gasoline Fuel Tank Pressure: The gage pressure of the vapor in the gasoline fuel tank.";
