CM_ BO_ 2633782014 "Bin Weight and Lift Count";
CM_ SG_ 2633782014 BinInstance "Bin Instance: Gives the instance of the bin on the vehicle whose parameters are transmitted in the remainder of the PG, with the first or only bin as instance 1.";
CM_ SG_ 2633782014 BinLiftCount "Bin Lift Count: Increments with each lift, whether or not net bin weight changes.  The count rolls over at data range limit.The count can be reset using SPN 6898 in PGN 56832.";
CM_ SG_ 2633782014 BinWeighingErrorStatus "Bin Weighing Error Status: Bin weighing error status0 = No error1 = Bad lift cycle2 = Weighing error: bin lifted, not emptied3 = Weighing error: empty bin lifted, emptied4 to 14 = Reserved15 = Not available / not applicable";
