CM_ BO_ 2633825022 "Electronic Engine Controller 11";
CM_ SG_ 2633825022 EngnExhstGsRrltn2Vlv1Cntrl "Engine Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 Valve 1 Control: Desired percentage of maximum Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 (EGR2) valve opening. 0% means the valve is closed. 100% means maximum opening (full gas flow).";
CM_ SG_ 2633825022 EngnExhstGsRrltn2Vlv1PstnErrr "Engine Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 Valve 1 Position Error: The position error of the Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 valve, determined as the actual position (SPN 5264) minus the commanded position (SPN 5262).";
CM_ SG_ 2633825022 EngnExhstGsRrltn2Vlv2Cntrl "Engine Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 Valve 2 Control: Desired percentage of maximum Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 (EGR2) valve 2 opening. 0% means the valve is closed. 100% means maximum opening (full gas flow).";
CM_ SG_ 2633825022 EngnExhstGsRrltn2Vlv2PstnErrr "Engine Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 Valve 2 Position Error: The position error of the Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 valve 2, determined as the actual position (SPN 5265) minus the commanded position (SPN 5263).";
CM_ BO_ 2633825534 "Engine Manifold Actuator Control";
CM_ SG_ 2633825534 EExstMdB1FwBVvAttCt "Engine Exhaust Manifold Bank 1 Flow Balance Valve Actuator Control: Commanded percentage of maximum Engine Exhaust Manifold Bank 1 Balance valve opening. 0% means valve is closed. 100% means maximum valve opening (full gas flow).";
CM_ SG_ 2633825534 EExstMdB2FwBVvAttCt "Engine Exhaust Manifold Bank 2 Flow Balance Valve Actuator Control: Commanded percentage of maximum Engine Ehaust Manifold Bank 2 Balance valve opening. 0% means valve is closed. 100% means maximum valve opening (full gas flow).";
CM_ BO_ 2633826046 "Electronic Engine Controller 10";
CM_ SG_ 2633826046 EExstGsRt2CBpssAttPst "Engine Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 Cooler Bypass Actuator Position: EGR2 Cooler Bypass Actuator position, where 0% = Fully Closed (no gas flowing through the bypass), and 100% = Fully Open..";
CM_ SG_ 2633826046 EngnExhstGsRrltn2ClrEffn "Engine Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 Cooler Efficiency: Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 cooler efficiency is an indication of the cooler's ability to reduce the temperature of the exhaust gas that is being recirculated back to the intake. 0% = no reduction...";
CM_ SG_ 2633826046 EngnExhstGsRrltn2ClrIntkPrssr "Engine Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 Cooler Intake Pressure: Exhaust gas recirculation 2 (EGR2) gage pressure is measured at the EGR2 cooler intake.";
CM_ SG_ 2633826046 EngnExhstGsRrltn2ClrIntkTmprtr "Engine Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 Cooler Intake Temperature: Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 (EGR2) Temperature measured at EGR2 cooler intake. See SPN 5255 for Engine EGR2 temperature.";
CM_ SG_ 2633826046 EExstGsRt2CItAstPss "Engine Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 Cooler Intake Absolute Pressure: Exhaust Gas Recirculation 2 gas absolute pressure is measured at EGR2 cooler intake. See SPN 5253 for EGR2 pressure measured at the EGR2 cooler outlet before the valve.";
