CM_ BO_ 2633853438 "Axle Group Calibration Weights";
CM_ SG_ 2633853438 AdditionalAxleGroupLocation "Additional Axle Group Location: Location of the axle group, listed from front of the vehicle to rear.  If the value of SPN 4074 is 15, then this SP is used to indicate the axle group referred to by this PG. Otherwise, this SP should be broadcast as 1...";
CM_ SG_ 2633853438 AxleGroupEmptyWeightCalibration "Axle Group Empty Weight Calibration: The empty weight calibration measurement of an axle group";
CM_ SG_ 2633853438 AxleGroupFullWeightCalibration "Axle Group Full Weight Calibration: The full weight calibration measurement of an axle group";
CM_ SG_ 2633853438 AxleGroupLocation "Axle Group Location: Specific axle group used in conjunction with and when communicating the axle group calibration, listed from the front of the vehicle to the rear.If the value of SPN 5936 is 1111b, then this SP is used to indicate the axle group r...";
CM_ BO_ 2633861886 "SAE J2012 2-Byte DTC Display";
CM_ SG_ 2633861886 NumberOfJ20122ByteDtcs "Number of J2012 2-Byte DTCs: The number of J2012 2-Byte DTCs being conveyed in PGN 64906.  If the value of this parameter is zero, the device broadcasting PGN 64906 has no active or previously active J2012 2-Byte DTCs.";
CM_ SG_ 2633861886 J20122ByteDtc "J2012 2-Byte DTC: Five character ASCII SAE J2012 2-Byte DTC, sent most significant byte first.";
CM_ SG_ 2633861886 J20122ByteDtcStatus "J2012 2-Byte DTC Status: Indicates if the respective SAE J2012 2-Byte DTC is active or previously active.0b = DTC is previously active1b = DTC is active";
CM_ SG_ 2633861886 J20122ByteDtcOccurrenceCount "J2012 2-Byte DTC Occurrence Count: Number of occurrences of the respective SAE J2012 2-Byte DTC being conveyed.If more than 126 occurrences happen the value shall be set to 126.If the occurrence count is not available to be sent then this value shall...";
CM_ BO_ 2633869310 "Voltage Regulator Operating Mode";
CM_ SG_ 2633869310 VltgRgltrLdCmpnstnMd "Voltage Regulator Load Compensation Mode: State signal indicating the voltage regulator load compensation mode.  Load compensation is when the voltage is adjusted based on the magnitude of load current000b = load compensation disabled001b = Voltage d...";
CM_ SG_ 2633869310 VoltageRegulatorEnabled "Voltage Regulator Enabled: State signal indicating the Voltage Regulator is enabled.  This parameter indicates whether the regulator is regulating or not regulating generator output voltage.00b = Not regulating voltage - unit disabled01b = Regulating...";
CM_ SG_ 2633869310 VoltageRegulatorSoftStartState "Voltage Regulator Soft Start State: State signal indicating the mode of the Voltage regulator soft start function.  Soft start controls the generator voltage overshoot by controlling the rate of rise of the generator output voltage at generator start...";
CM_ SG_ 2633869310 VltgRgltrVrPwrFtrOprtngMd "Voltage Regulator VAr/Power Factor operating mode: State signal indicating the operating mode for the Voltage regulator VAr/Power Factor 000b = VAr/Power Factor regulation disabled001b = Power factor regulation enabled010b = VAr regulation enabled011...";
CM_ SG_ 2633869310 VltgRgltrUndrfrqnCmpnstnEnld "Voltage Regulator Underfrequency Compensation enabled: State signal indicating the operating mode for underfrequency compensation.00b = Underfrequency compensation disabled01b = Underfrequency compensation enabled10b = Reserved11b = Not availableNote...";
CM_ BO_ 2633878014 "Electronic Control Module Information";
CM_ SG_ 2633878014 TtlCntOfCnfgrtnChngsMd "Total Count of Configuration Changes Made: Total number of times changes have been made to any of the configurable parameters.";
CM_ BO_ 2633880062 "FMS-standard Interface Identity/Capabilities";
