CM_ SG_ 2633926398 EngineCylinder20IgnitionTiming "Engine Cylinder 20 Ignition Timing: The ignition timing (SI engines) or main fuel injection timing (CI engines) of the cylinder. Positive values indicate an increasingly advanced timing from TDC.";
