CM_ SG_ 2633926654 EngineDesiredIgnitionTiming3 "Engine Desired Ignition Timing 3: A programmable timing value specific to the engine's application. Factors affecting this value include both fuel type and the nature of the load being driven. Positive values indicate an increasingly advanced timing ...";
