CM_ SG_ 2633927678 EngnFlVlv1DffrntlPrssr "Engine Fuel Valve 1 Differential Pressure: The differential pressure between the intake and the outlet of the first or only gaseous fuel valve.See SPN 8494 for alternate range and resolution.";
CM_ SG_ 2633927678 EngnFlVlv1IntkAsltPrssr "Engine Fuel Valve 1 Intake Absolute Pressure: The absolute pressure of gas on the intake side of the first system control valve.  See SPN 3466 for Engine Fuel Valve 2, 7505 for Engine Fuel Valve 3 & 7506 for Engine Fuel Valve 4.";
CM_ SG_ 2633927678 EngnFlVlv1OtltAsltPrssr "Engine Fuel Valve 1 Outlet Absolute Pressure: Absolute Pressure of gas on outlet side of the first or only fuel system control valve.  See SPN 3469 for the second fuel control valve.";
CM_ BO_ 2633927934 "Auxiliary Analog Information";
CM_ SG_ 2633927934 AuxiliaryLevel "Auxiliary Level: Level measured by a sensor.";
CM_ SG_ 2633927934 AuxiliaryPressure1 "Auxiliary Pressure #1: Pressure measured by auxiliary pressure sensor #1.  Not to be used in place of existing SPs.";
CM_ SG_ 2633927934 AuxiliaryPressure2 "Auxiliary Pressure #2: Pressure measured by auxiliary pressure sensor #2.  Not to be used in place of existing SPs.";
CM_ SG_ 2633927934 AuxiliaryTemperature1 "Auxiliary Temperature 1: Temperature measured by auxiliary temperature sensor #1.  Not to be used in place of existing SPs.";
