CM_ SG_ 2633943038 TrnsmssnSplttrDrtAttr "Transmission Splitter Direct Actuator: Identifies the status of the splitter direct actuator in the auxiliary unit.00b = Off01b = On10b = Error11b = Not available";
CM_ SG_ 2633943038 TrnsmssnSplttrIndrtAttr "Transmission Splitter Indirect Actuator: Identifies the status of the splitter indirect actuator in the auxiliary unit.00b = Off01b = On10b = Error11b = Not available";
