CM_ SG_ 2565865726 RetarderSelectionNonEngine "Retarder Selection, non-engine: The 'Retarder Selection, non-engine' is the position of the driver's selector for retarders that are not part of the engine system, expressed as percent and determined by the ratio of current position to the maximum po...";
