CM_ SG_ 2566621694 EngineOilLevel1State "Engine Oil Level 1 State: First instance of engine oil level switch which indicates if engine oil level is low or normal.See SPN 22723 for the second instance of engine oil level state.00b = Low01b = Normal10b = Error11b = Not available";
