CM_ SG_ 2365295358 HvssTtlStrdEnrgSrLvl "HVESS Total Stored Energy Source Level: This is the total percentage of the HVES useable capacity, including both online and offline packs. For the capacity of connected packs only, see SPN 7895.   ";
CM_ SG_ 2365295358 HvssPwrMdlEltrnsTmprtr "HVESS Power Module Electronics Temperature: Parameter indicating the temperature of the power module electronics (e.g., DC/DC converter, switch, heatsink) in the HVESS.";
