CM_ SG_ 2566622462 EnmMdEstmtdInstntnsFlSvngsRt "Economy Mode Estimated Instantaneous Fuel Savings Rate: Estimated instantaneous fuel savings rate while operating in economy mode.  This is in comparison to operating in a non-economy mode.";
